+/// Index in `subs` of the MS of a stream that numbers it the console's way (`CONSOLE_MS`):
+/// a console MS container there and no PC MS (25) in the stream.
+unsafe fn console_numbered_ms(subs: &[(u32, &[u8])]) -> Option<usize> {
